<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Friday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 3.77 to 635.47, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.10.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 316 to 243.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,174,420 compared with 22,031,150 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
